ust enhance different abilities through various activities or courses within the protagonist's limited lifespan. The ultimate goal is to marry twelve beautiful female protagonists back home, form a happy family together, and give birth to a baby boy to complete the mission of receiving the family. Even able to lead the heroes of Liangshan to kill Gao Qiu and resist the Song and Jin dynasties.<br><br><br><br>You need to showcase your talents along the way. Choose various roads? Your attack, defense, and health all depend on the path you choose.<br><br><br><br>Every decision is of great significance, especially in social life. You need to balance friendship, love, work, leisure, interpersonal relationships, and potential celebrity identities. You also need to learn and search for the scattered heroes of Liangshan in the martial arts world, kill Gao Qiu, resist the Song Dynasty, and resist the Jin Dynasty.<br><br><br><br>-Simulation of plot development management with role-playing and development elements<br><br>-Marry twelve beautiful female protagonists in order and bring them home, forming a happy family together. They will also give birth to a baby boy to complete the mission of receiving the family. Even able to lead the heroes of Liangshan to kill Gao Qiu, resist the Song Dynasty, and resist the Jin Dynasty<br><br>-Driven by the story, different plots can be chosen and different game endings can be explored<br><br>-Gain a deep understanding of statistical data and use extensive skills to determine one's own path<br><br>-Pixel based visuals, all reflecting the style of the Northern Song Dynasty, exuding a strong retro atmosphere",
